{"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/swidux\/agentskill"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"sections":[],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/AgentSkill"},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Install the bundled "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"swidux-ref"},{"type":"text","text":" skill so your AI coding assistant has Swidux’s architecture rules and code templates on hand."}],"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"type":"heading","text":"Overview","level":2,"anchor":"Overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Swidux ships a companion agent skill (","type":"text"},{"code":"swidux-ref","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":") for AI coding assistants like Claude Code. It contains the architecture rules, conventions, and code templates an assistant needs to generate correct Swidux code without you re-explaining the patterns.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The skill is published in ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/heirloomlogic\/skills","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" — Heirloom Logic’s public skills repo — alongside any future Heirloom skills. Two files:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"SKILL.md","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" — architecture rules (the 10 rules, the dispatch lifecycle, plugin shapes, anti-patterns)."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"swidux-patterns.md","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" — copy-pasteable code templates for "},{"code":"AppState","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"code":"AppAction","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", reducers, "},{"code":"AppStore","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" factory, views, plugin wiring, and Swift Testing reducer tests."}]}]}]},{"type":"heading","text":"Installing the skill","level":2,"anchor":"Installing-the-skill"},{"type